Package: amogos-update
Version: 2.0.0-1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: AmogOS
Depends: dash, coreutils, dpkg
Description: Versioned AmogOS system update migrations
 Runs the packaged AmogOS migration script when a newer package version
 is configured by APT or dpkg. The initial migration is a no-op.
